# D0 loader (iOS Diag Loader) on a physical Erista (t210b01=0, sku=0), 2026-11-25, hekate 6.5.5.
# Transcribed by the reviewer from the photograph IMG_1016.JPG and given to this repository as text; the photograph was not
# seen here. Header, 25 MC rows and 6 GIC rows exactly as transcribed. The run ended with the loader's last line below and
# hekate came back by itself (confirmed by the operator, not in the photograph).
